    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have become an instrument of the Maker’s truth. Your voice no longer requires effort. It simply is.</p><p><strong>Word of Judgment.</strong> When you use Voice of Authority, you can affect an additional creature of your choice within 30 feet that can hear you. It must make a separate Wisdom saving throw.</p><p><strong>Irresistible Cadence.</strong> Once per turn when a creature succeeds on its saving throw against your Stunning Strike or Voice of Authority, you can spend 2 Focus Points to force it to reroll the d20. It must use the new result.</p>"
